  "//": [
    "test: --timeout 10000 is at least twice the slowest row of this package, read on a 288-CPU dev box on 2026-11-22: row-deadline.test.ts's a wait ends at the deadline of a file's afterEach that follows a row, which runs a bun test of its own, took 2,560.28, 2,543.41 and 2,540.19 ms in three runs of this command at a one-minute load of 690 to 721, and 3,234.59 ms in a run of bare bun test at a load of about 950; 10000 holds that 3.09 times. A row that runs a bun test of its own is the machine's, and its guard is an open risk: at a load of 1,393 a row of that shape (fake-clock.test.ts's wait that never ends, as #4437 rewrites it) took 10,646 ms against this guard."
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "bunx tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "bun test --timeout 10000 --preload @legion/test-fixtures/row-deadline",
    "lint": "bunx biome check src/"
  },
